Multiplication table.

This prints the multiplication table from 1 x 1 to 10 x 10, one row per line.
Every number is preceded by a space, so every row starts with one. Both
counters count down and the output is served from the top of the baking dish,
so everything comes out in reverse order, i.e. ascending.

Ingredients.
10 i
10 j
10 ten
32 ml space
10 ml newline
result

Method.
Analyze the i.
Put ten into mixing bowl.
Fold j into mixing bowl.
Put newline into 2nd mixing bowl.
Examine the j.
Put j into mixing bowl.
Combine i.
Fold result into mixing bowl.
Put result into 2nd mixing bowl.
Put space into 2nd mixing bowl.
Decrement the j until examined.
Decrement the i until analyzed.
Pour contents of the 2nd mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
